Z||000000||Wolfhound||03-20-2001||07:24 PM||||I found an ad for a nonrunning 87 Fiero in Atlanta for a $100.00. I went to check it out and it was an 84 SE. It has all options availiable in 84, power windows,locks,and mirrors, rear defrost, air, sunroof, automatic, new paint.<BR> It,s not running because someone chewed up the switch trying to steal it off the lot.<BR>One window was stuck down because the battery was missing. Interior and seats are in good shape. You should have seen a used car salesman trying to convince me to buy a $100.00 car. Almost told him to shut up and take my money.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> Here are a couple of photos of the rare $100.00 Fiero.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/outsi.JPG"> <BR>It was raining and there was water on my lens. no damage to front facia.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/insi.JPG"> <BR>This car had Four rare pine tree air fresheners. <BR>||||reg||10
